            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceGary]Blue: \\bThe volcano erupts, and just like that, a whole city disappears."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceGary]\\bWe can go on winning and losing in Pokemon, but if nature so much as twitches, we can be overwhelmed in a second..."
