            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceGary]\\bThat's the way it is...\\nBut, anyway, I'm still a Trainer."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceGary]\\bIf I see a strong opponent, it makes me want to battle."
