            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceyellow]\\rProfesor Oak told me you were here, so I came as fast as I could."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceyellow]\\rI couldn’t risk calling.\\nFeels like every line’s being monitored these days."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceyellow]\\rSomething very strange is going on in the TV Tower in Lavender."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceyellow]\\rGiovanni’s basically moved in there. He’s always at the tower now, running broadcasts, speeches, ‘updates.’\\nBut it’s not just news, it’s all carefully controlled."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceyellow]\\rIt’s nonstop propaganda. His face, his promises… all day, every channel."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceyellow]\\rHe’s not just running the Association… he’s building control.\\nTotal control."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceyellow]\\rIf he owns the media, he owns the story…\\nand I'm afraid the people will follow."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceyellow]\\rI need your help to figure out what’s really going on inside that tower."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceyellow]\\rThe truth’s buried under all that noise, I know something’s wrong."
            },
            {"cmd":"call","fn":"pbCallBub","args":[2,{"call":"@event_id"}]},
            {
              "cmd": "text",
              "text": "\\f[faceyellow]\\rI'll wait for you there. We can’t let him rewrite the truth..."
            },
            {"cmd":"scrollMap","direction":2,"distance":3,"speed":4},
